      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stockdale%2C_Texas",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before becoming Stockdale, the area was known as High Prairie, Free Timber, and Bunker's Store, reflecting its early frontier roots.",
